      ":question/math-academy-id": "q-11911",
      ":question/problem": "Given that $y=2x+ln⁡x$, find $\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}.$",
      ":question/worked-solution": "Taking the derivative, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(2x+ln⁡x) \\\\  & =2+\\frac{1}{x}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"
